    overview_html: `<p>Call of Duty: Modern Warfare III uses identical seasonal battle pass structure to Warzone, with $69.99 base game plus optional cosmetics. The paid battle pass is $9.99 per season, offering 100 tiers of cosmetic progression. Modern Warfare III's monetization is cosmetic-focused, with gameplay remaining completely free. However, the cosmetic store is aggressive with $15-25 bundles and constant FOMO mechanics.</p><p>Seasonal content updates are robust, with new weapons, maps, and gameplay balance changes keeping engagement high. The $9.99 pass cost is reasonable, but cosmetic inflation makes total seasonal spending $30-50+ for hardcore fans. The game requires the $69.99 purchase upfront, distinguishing it from free-to-play Warzone.</p>`,
